tool.heal.name = Polosi Fakamoʻui
tool.heal.description = Polosi Fakamoʻui: lomi-alt ke fokotuʻu ʻa e tupuʻangá, pea vali; ʻoku tuifio ʻa e anga ʻo e fukahi meʻa mei he tupuʻangá mo e lanu mo e maama ʻo e feituʻu ʻoku ʻave ki aí.
